<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ScutariLabs | SDK Directory</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Zero-cloud, on-device Flutter & mobile SDKs by ScutariLabs." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0c10;
      --surface: #11151c;
      --border: #1f2937;
      --border-hover: #38bdf8;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #9ca3af;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --live: #22c55e;
      --dev: #f59e0b;
      --mono: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace;
      --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Top Nav */
    .top-nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .top-nav a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.15s ease;
    }

    .top-nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 620px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    /* Directory List */
    .sdk-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .sdk-card {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      transition: border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .sdk-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-hover);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .sdk-card.disabled {
      opacity: 0.65;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .sdk-title {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .badge {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid currentColor;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .badge-live { color: var(--live); }
    .badge-dev { color: var(--dev); }

    .sdk-desc {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
    }

    .card-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .tag {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .cta {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 3.5rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    footer a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="top-nav">
      <a href="/">← ScutariLabs Home</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/blog.html">Blog</a>
        <a href="/sdk/" style="color: var(--text);">SDKs</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <header>
      <div class="eyebrow">Developer Libraries // Zero-Cloud Architecture</div>
      <h1>ScutariLabs SDK Directory</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Drop-in, offline-first mobile SDKs built for hardware telemetry, security, and local AI execution—zero external API calls, zero recurring server dependencies.
      </p>
    </header>

    <main class="sdk-list">
      <!-- SDK 1: ScutariCore -->
      <a href="/sdk/scutaricore/" class="sdk-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="sdk-title">ScutariCore SDK</span>
          <span class="badge badge-live">Available</span>
        </div>
        <p class="sdk-desc">
          Hardware profiling, thermal governor telemetry, and offline sensor security primitives for Flutter and Android applications. Dual-licensed for indie and commercial teams.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">Flutter / Dart</span>
            <span class="tag">Offline-First</span>
            <span class="tag">Dual-License</span>
          </div>
          <span class="cta">View Docs &amp; Pricing →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Placeholder for Future SDKs (Remove 'disabled' class and set href when live) -->
      <div class="sdk-card disabled">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="sdk-title">Upcoming Module</span>
          <span class="badge badge-dev">In Development</span>
        </div>
        <p class="sdk-desc">
          Additional on-device security, audio classification, and local network inspection SDKs currently in internal testing.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">Zero-Cloud</span>
            <span class="tag">Mobile Security</span>
          </div>
          <span class="cta">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>© ScutariLabs Ltd</span>
      <a href="/">scutarilabs.com</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
